Subject: [PATCH 300/488] Speculative decoding: refresh random draws across
 block-verification rounds

Backport vllm-project/vllm#61161 and the residual lookahead bounds fix in #60945 to the r6x source. Preserve step-zero draws and temperature-zero verification. Add the upstream multi-round distribution regression and DSpark repeated-position check. The watermark implementation here has no cached draft fallback, so that upstream hunk does not apply.
